# {{ name }}

An ISKG dashboard with metric cards, a progress gauge, a sparkline,
and a time-series chart. Ticks once per second with random values.

## Run

```bash
iskg run app.py
```

## What's inside

* `ProgressCircle` — animated determinate circle.
* `Sparkline` — compact inline chart.
* `TimeSeriesGraph` — full time-series line chart.
* `BarChart` — categorical bar chart.

Replace the random `tick()` body with your real data source.
